{"key":"map/gz1d2","relations":[{"id":"person","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"character/merc2","title":"Kel","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"character/clerk","title":"Official","variant":""}],"title":"Related characters"},{"id":"inhabitant","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone1dun2%20bat","title":"Small bat","variant":""},{"detail":"","key":"creature/zone1dun2%20rat","title":"Young rat","variant":""}],"title":"Creatures and people"},{"id":"quest","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"quest/q03h","title":"The Catacombs","variant":""}],"title":"Quests"},{"id":"exit","rows":[{"detail":"","key":"map/cz2h","title":"Catacomb exit","variant":""}],"title":"Connected locations"}],"versions":[{"guide":"","html":"<article><h1>Catacombs</h1><p>Abandoned catacombs provide a route out of the fortress surrounding the Portal.</p><h2>Kel and the slave pen</h2><p>Soldiers beat Kir nearly to death. In the slave pen, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> nurses him back to consciousness, shortens his name to Kir and offers a partnership in escape. He initially hopes to explain the mistake to the authorities; the <a href=\"wiki://character/clerk\">official</a> instead assigns work according to the prisoners’ abilities. Kel has overheard that an officer possesses a map of the catacombs. They escape and use the underground route to leave the fortress area. Once outside, Kel proposes refuge with an acquaintance who collects spiders. Their relationship begins in this shared dependence: Kir needs her local knowledge, and Kel needs a partner. [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]</p><h2>Sources</h2><p>Based on the original dialogue, quest journals and world descriptions. Source numbers identify the evidence listed below.</p><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>#</th><th>Sources</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_2)</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/clerk\">Official</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_3a)</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/clerk\">Official</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_3b)</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/clerk\">Official</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a> (briefing brief_3c)</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_4)</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_5)</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>Dialogue · <a href=\"wiki://character/hero\">Kir</a>, <a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a> (briefing brief_5a)</td></tr></table><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Property</th><th>Value</th></tr><tr><td>Island</td><td><a href=\"wiki://allod/suslanger\">Suslanger</a></td></tr></table><h2>Connected locations</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Maps</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://map/cz2h\">Catacomb exit</a></td></tr></table><h2>Quests</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Quests</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://quest/q03h\">The Catacombs</a></td></tr></table><h2>Related characters</h2><table data-columns=\"1\"><tr><th>Related page</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/merc2\">Kel</a></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://character/clerk\">Official</a></td></tr></table><h2>Creatures and people</h2><table data-columns=\"2\"><tr><th>Related page</th><th>Details</th></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/zone1dun2%20bat\">Small bat</a></td><td /></tr><tr><td><a href=\"wiki://creature/zone1dun2%20rat\">Young rat</a></td><td /></tr></table></article>","id":"","image":"880e07bb4f7ab9189cdbbcdf","pins":[{"key":"map/cz2h","kind":"exit","title":"Catacomb exit","x":0.69140625,"y":0.09